<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Alago Bible Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Osayi ko Oyohana</para>
  <para style="toc1">Osayi ko Oyohana</para>
  <para style="toc2">Osayi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Osa.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Osayi</para>
  <para style="mt3">ko Oyohana</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Okpa mani tawoza ni Oyesu Okristi sayi ni. Owuso sayi danu ko shiya ayole nu oza ni ya gbeji kelo ya wa gbodagye ni. Okristi sayi kawoza mani doyole nu ko Oyohana. Oto oyoleho nu oleho gebe nu, <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />Oyohana ke kojoji ni oma ni. Omani wela ko Owuso kpolobene kela kokwokwoshi ni Oyesu Okristi sayi ni. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Otunehe yo kpase ni kokpa mani, aboneshi ki yo kpase ni pwoshu ni obane ni kweyi yela kokpa mani tipu kotu wa, ikweyi koni ishi yaba nwa kelo ni awoza mani ba wa gbodagye ni.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ata Awoda ko Owuso Ahapa Ogbogba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Bwebe ko Oyohana gawoda ko Owuso ahapa ni bo okpagye ka Asiya ni:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4">Eshi kpo omene na yo kpala bwebe ko Owuso, ni we, ni kwobonu we, ni ki yawa ni, ki bwebe kawomaku ahapa ni bohobu kobe nu ni, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />ki bwebe ko Oyesu Okristi, ni wolobene kokwokwoshi, oyi kikyikyo ko nyiso bwikwu, kpino kpogwu kawose kese kpiri.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">Oyimu kaha, kweyi ongmaha shozalabi bwebe kikwu nu, <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />kweyi oyaha wo obula kawosapa ko yoko do Owuso nu kpa Ada nu. Igyashi kposhu wako Oyesu Okristi ko gbogbo-gbogbo. Nalemani.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Ma, ose yawa ikweyi ka akpa! Ananoho ba mo, kawase ni tokpa ni. Ase kese kpiri ba byotu ikweyi nu. Onalemani!<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />Adole Owuso kamo, &lt;&lt;Ami wa Alfa, ami wo Omega, Owuso ni we, ni kwobonu we, ni ki yawa ni, Ine koshu kpiri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Osayi ko Okristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Ami wo Oyohana, oyene kala, oya kala ipu ko owe moma kpo obula kpo otuzoze ni wakaka ipu ko Oyesu ni. Ayun tokpagye ko Opatumos ni inyo shogba to ni, ikweyi koni ntono ke Ela ko Owuso kpo kwokwoshi ni Oyesu sayi ni. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Eno ko Owuso nyyipu ko Omaku kweyi npwoko nyakwu, ni ya yeya bya ajigwo ni, ya kela itikpi hin. <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />Oko kamo, &lt;&lt;Toza ni oma ni, kweyi toleho kokpa ni gawoda ko Owuso ahapa ni ba wogya nyakwu ahapa mani: Efesu, Osumayina, Opegamo, Otiyatira, Osardis, Ofiladefiya, kpo Olawudikiya.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Npyiyi ko mase ni ya kela dami ni, kweyi nmo oda ko ozinariya ahapa ni aba yi ikwomu hi ikweyi wa ni, <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />kweyi ipu wa oje byasuse, shoshiye wurututu ni fikpo nuni, kweyi yo gbogbo ko ozinariya gbotu. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Inyeyi nu shehe byo omowu, kwe ebwu, kweyi iyi nu ya kye byola ni. <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />Ikpo nu ba yu byogye ni ya shola ni, kweyi oko nu ya yeya byinyo ni yape kposhu ni. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Obyi inyiwo ahapa abore nu, kweyi ewakpa oye ni ya re kotata agbabo pepa ni bose bwokwunu nu. Aheyi nu ya yu byo oyoyu ke eno kisheno. <verse eid="REV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Ishini nmo ni, ngbo obutu nu byo okwu ni. Oya abore nu sun kweyi kamo: &lt;&lt;Ka yoshi lo! Ami wikyikyo, ami wo gwejeji. <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Ami wase iyiyi ni! Ngekwu, anani ke nyyiyi ko gbogbo-gbogbo. Ngboshu ikweyi kikwu kpa Aleku.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ohadesi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ohadesi webe ni awase ni gekwu banu ni </char></note> <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Ni olemani, tawoza ni oma ni, awoza ni oyama anani, kpa awoza niba gbodagye ohobu ni. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Omani wikweyi ki inyiwo ahapa ni oma abore hin ni kpo oda ko ozinariya ahapa ni aba yi ikwomu hi ikweyi wa ni: inyiwo ahapa oni wa ayoleho ko Owuso ahapa, kweyi oda ki ikwomu ahapa ni wa awoda ko Owuso ahapa.<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s">Oleho ge Efesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />Ta do oyoleho ko oda ko Owuso ke Efesu mo: &lt;&lt;Omani wo oleho bwebe kase ni byi inyiwo ahapa abore nu, ni ki ya yawu ebe ki ikwomu ko ozinariya ahapa ni. <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />Ngyoza ni oya ya ni; ngyo owe koko ni oya ni kpo otu mene ni ogbo ni. Ngye kamo oya kyogwu kpase bibi lo, awase ni mawa wa ayikoko ko Oyesu ake we lo ni, omuwama kweyi ogye kamo aba kokame la. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Ogbotu mene, omowe ikweyi hin, oke nwa lo. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Ozani ke shiwo hin kpawo ni yoma: anani oya yimu hin byoni oyimu hin bwikyikyo ni kelo. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Rela kigbo ni ogbo ni! Shagbotu shini oyoza ni oya ikyikyo ni. Owoni oshagbotu lo, nyya wa tawo kweyi yo oda ki ikwomu wo ya bize shebe ni oya nu ni. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Oza neshi ni oke ya ni yoma: oya kyogwu kpo oza ni ikpo ko Onikolata baya ni lo, byo ni ami ya kyogwu kpawa lo ni.<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />&lt;&lt;Ase ni gbakpaha, ona pwoza ni Omaku ko Owuso ya kado awoda ko Owuso ni!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:7">&lt;&lt;Ase ni rogwa, nyya danu oshu ko hogwogwa kefu ko olayi ni ya gye ipu ke Eho ko Owuso ni.<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oleho go Osumayina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />&lt;&lt;Ta do oyoleho koda ko Owuso ko Osumayina: &lt;&lt;Omani wo oleho bwebe kase ni wikyikyo kpo gwejeji ni, ni gekwu ki nyiso yo kpo olayi ni. <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />Nggyotu byobya wo; ngye kamo owo oleha la, okwokwoshi nu ke owolodu la! Ngyela bibi ni awase ni kokame mawa wase ko Oyahuda baka ikweyi wo ni, ake wase ko Oyahuda lalo; Awayi kikpo ki Ibiri la! <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Ka yoshi ko owe oyoye ni ya wa tawo ni lo. Pwo! Ibiri ya wa malama, bwebe ko ya ashini kala shetu, kweyi otubyobya kala ya ye eno igwo. Hagye giri dami, ka ko gekwu. Ami ke ya dala olayi ni wa abola ko ogwarore kala ni.<verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />&lt;&lt;Ase ni gbakpaha, ona pwoza ni Omaku ya ka da awoda ko Owuso ni!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:11">&lt;&lt;Awase ni rogwa ikwu ko omwepa ya ngmuwa lo.<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oleho Goda ko Owuso ko Opegamus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />&lt;&lt;Ta gebe ko oyoleho koda ko Owuso ko Opegamus kamo: Omani wo oleho bwebe kase ni gbe ewakpa rore agbabo pepa ni. <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Ngyebe ko yagye wo, ebeni obe ki Ibiri yanu ni. Ala wase hin kokwokwoshi, kwikyikye ni otuse ni ala gbo ikweyi hin ni loshu, kishi ni ayo olobene hin kokwokwoshi, Antipas ngmo ebeni Ibiri yagye ni. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Oza gbayayi ni ke shiwo hin kpala ni yoma: ase ashini ipu kala ba gboso ozafofu ko Obalam, ni fo Obalak oza ni oya ya ko ya ase ki Izrayila na yo ozalabi ni, okpuwo okwunu ga roza ni ayi peka ni kpeba boba. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Mamani ala gbawase ipu kala ni ba gboso ozafofu ko Onikolata ni. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Anani ala shagbotu! Owoni ala shagbotu lo, oya gbeji kelo nyya wa kpefu kpa awase ni kpe ewakpa ni ya bose bwo okwunu hin ni<verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />&lt;&lt;Ase ni gbakpaha, na pwoza ni Omaku ya ka da awoda ko Owuso ni!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:17">&lt;&lt;Awase ni rogwa, aba hoza rore ni ase gye lo, ni aba yogwu mo omana ni. Nki ya da ananoho wa ikyikpo nehe, ni atiye pepe na ashishe gye lo ni anu, ase ni nye ni kin pini ya gye la.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oleho go Otiyatira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />Ta do oyoleho ko oda ko Owuso ko Otiyatira kamo:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:18">&lt;&lt;Oleho mani bwebe ko Oyi ko Owuso ni iyi nu ya kye byi igbenu kola ni, ni ikponu ya yu byo ogye ngla-ngla ni. <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Nggyoza ni oyaya ni. Nggyimu yoya kpo otuse wo, okwokwoshi wo, oko wo, kpotu mene wo. Ngye kamo oya yoko anani shoko ni oya ikyikyo ni. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Ozani ke shiwo hin kpawo ni yoma: okyogwu kpo onya ni aba yogwu mo Ojezebel, ni ya yiyinu ogwu manu wo oyoleho ko Owuso ni. Ozafofu nu ya ayole hin ba gebe keba boba, kpo oza rore ni ayi peka ni. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Ndanu ishi koni oya shagbotu ni, oke gbimu ko sheba boba bita lo. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Mani oni nyya yo to ogwudu ebeni anu kpa awase ni beba kpanu ni ba mowe kotata ni. Nyya yoza mani anani owoni ashagbotu koza bibi ni aya kpanu ni lo. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Nki ya yawo gboso ya ngmo, kweyi awoda ko Owuso kpiri ba gye mami gyotu kpimu kotu ka ananoho. Nyya da ananoho abola gyogye kpo oza ni oya ni.<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />&lt;&lt;Ashini kala ase ko Otiyatira ke gboso ozafofu bibi mani lo; ala foza ni ashini kase ba yogwu mo &lt;Oza libwu ki ibiri&gt; lo. Nka dala kamo nyya sala enu oyoye lo. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Ala ke yabo byoza ni yabo kala ni pya, gbishi ni nyya wa ni. <verse eid="REV 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Ase ni rogwa, ni gohobu koza ni nyya yimu ni go okweyi. Nyya danu oshu ni Ada hin dami ni: nyya dawo oshu ikweyi ko okpagye kpiri, <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />oya kpogwu wa kpo okute kogye ko ki yuwa kya buru-buru bye eyi ka agye. <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />Nki ya dawi inyiwo kotukpokyi<verse eid="REV 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />&lt;&lt;Ase ni gbakpaha, ona pwoza ni Omaku ko Owuso ka da awoda ko Owuso ni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="cl">Oleho go Osardis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />&lt;&lt;Ta gebe ko oyoleho ko oda ko Owuso ko Osardis:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:1">&lt;&lt;Omani wo oleho bwebe kase ni gbo omaku ahapa ko Owuso kpi inyiwo ahapa. Ngyo oko wo; ngye kamo oriye mo ogbo olayi, oke gekwu. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Shiyi, shini oyabo byoza ni shishini dawo ni imbe ona gekwu kpiri-kpiri. Ikweyi koni nmoza ni oya ni shoshi obutu ko Owuso hin lo. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Rela koza ni afo kpo oza ni opwo ni; geyagye danu kweyi pyitikpi to ozalabi wo. Owoni onyiso lo, nyya wa dawo byo owi, oke ya gyi ishini nyya wa ni lo. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Ase gbayayi ipu kala ase ko Osardis ke wase neshi ko Owuso. Aba yawu kpami, kpo oshiye nehe, ikweyi koni ashu ko ya mani. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Awase ni rogwa aba shuwo oshiye nehe mani, kweyi nyya yi iye wa ngma shipu kokpa ko olayi lo. Nyya ka oko nyakwu obutu ka Ada hin kpa ayoleho nu mo awakaka hin.<verse eid="REV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />&lt;&lt;Ase ni gbakpaha, ona pwoza ni Omaku ya ka da awoda ko Owuso ni!<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oleho go Ofiladefiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />&lt;&lt;Ta gebe ko oyoleho ko oda ko Owuso ko Ofiladefiya mo:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:7">&lt;&lt;Oleho mani bwebe kase ni wo osere kpo okwokwoshi ni. Obyo oba kofunu ko Odawuda, ishini ogwofunu, ashishe ya yigwu lo, ishini oyi gwu, ashishe ya yi gwa lo. <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />Ngyo oko wo; ngye kamo oshu wo le gbayayi; ogboso ozafofu hin, kweyi ohagye giri dami. Nyyofunu gwogwa dawo, ni ashishe ya gege ya yigwu lo ni. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Pwo! Ela kikpo ni wa ki ibiri oni, awo kokame ni mawa wase ko Oyahuda ni ake we lo ni, nyya yuwa ba kwagye dala. Kpiri wa ba gye mo nyya yimu kala. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Ikweyi koni ala gboso ono hin kweyi zotu ni, ami ya gbala mamani ishi kebi ni ya wese mani ko wa mase kese kpiri ma ni. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Oya gbeji kelo nyya wa. Ala yabo byoza ni ala gbo ni piya, shini ashishe naka ya abola kala nu shala lo. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Nyya yawase ni rogwa ni ba wite kole ko Owuso hin, kweyi ojije ya yuwa ba bose sho lo. Nyya tiye ko Owuso hin ikpiye wa kpi iye ko ogya nyakwu ko Owuso hin, Ojerusele pepe, ni ya wokpagye bwi iso ebe ko Owuso hin ni. Nki ya tiye hin pepe ikpiye wa.<verse eid="REV 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />&lt;&lt;Ase ni gbakpaha, ona pwoza ni Omaku ya ka da awoda ko Owuso ni!<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oleho go Olawudikiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />&lt;&lt;Ta gebe ko oyoleho ko oda ko Owuso ko Olawudikiya kamo:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:14">&lt;&lt;Omani wo oleho bwebe ko Nalemani, olobene kokwokwoshi kpo otata, ni wotu kojoji ni Owuso ya ni. <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />Ngyo oko wo; ngye kamo okwola lo, oke sha lo. Obi ya shoshi shini okwola kwe osha! <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Ikweyi koni oya wule-wule, ni okwola lo oke sha lo ni, nyya to shonu bwo okwunu hin! <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Oya kamo, &lt;Nwwo olodu; ngboza nwashika, ngbo ojoji ni nyya yimu ni.&gt; Oke gye mo owo omushashi kpoza kiyinyinyi la lo! Owo oleha, oyewewa oki wo ofiyi. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Mani oni nyya dawela mo ro ozinariya, ni aya kpo ola ni, oyayo ya wolodu. Ro oshiye nehe shini oshoko ko yi iweyi kewewa wo gwu. Ra ano shini oki nyiyi wo, sho mebe. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Awase ni nyya yimu ni nyya gbuwapwo ki ya gbuwogo agye. Ni olemani hagye giri shini oshagbotu. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Ala pwo! Nhagye owofunu ya gwabo ofunu; ase ni pwoko hin kweyi gwofunu, nyya wipu kole nu kweyi nyya roza kpanu, anu ki ya roza kpa ami. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Awase ni rogwa ni, nyya dawo oshu ko yagye kwun obe hin, byoni ami kwobonu rogwa kweyi anani nyyagye kwa Ada hin obe nu ni.<verse eid="REV 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />&lt;&lt;Ase ni gbakpaha, ona pwoza ni Omaku ya ka da awoda ko Owuso ni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s">Igyashi ko Owuso Ipu ki Iso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Itikpi koni aki sayi koje dami, nmofunu gwogwa iso.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:1">Kweyi npwoko ni ya yeya bya ajigwo ni npwo ya kela kpami ikyikyo ni kamo, &lt;&lt;Webeni, nyya shawo oza ni wotiri ko gbodagye itikpi komani ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Ebebeni ngipu ko Omaku. Nmo obe oye iso kpa ashe yagye ikweyi nu. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Aheyi nu ya yu bya akyo ni gbakwekye ni aba yogwu mo ojaspa kpo okaneliya ni kweyi owusoshogwa bose ni shogba to obe, ni ya yu byo okpo ni aba yo mo emera. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Obe awepa ayene shogba to obe ni, awanyakwase awepa ayene bagye ikweyi wa sho oshiye nehe kpo otu ko ozinariya ikweyi wa. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Owusotasha bwo obe, owuso yagbo kweyi akpula gbo. Emu ahapa ni bakye ohobu ko obe, ni wo omaku ahapa ko Owuso ni.<verse eid="REV 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Mamani ohobu ko obe oje lebyi ishu ki iyimebe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Awobize ene hagye shogba to obe, agbiyi kohobu kitikpi. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Obize kikyikyo lebya abaga; ko omwepa lebye ena, ako omweta aheyi nu lebya aka asuse; omene lebye eto. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Awobize ene mani gbakya ihiri, kpiri kakya mani gbiyi gyehe to kipu kese. Keno kotu ashigye ko wowo bita lo, aba kamo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">&lt;&lt;Ase neshi, neshi, neshi, Adole Owuso Ine-koshu-kpiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:8">anu ni kwobonu we, oki we, oki yawa we.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Awobize ene mani wigye kigyashi kpa abokpa kpo otunehe dase ni yo obe ni, anu ni yaba ko gbogbo-gbogbo ni. Ishini aya ma ni, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />anyakwase awepa ayene kwagye dase ni yo obe ni, kweyi geyagye dase ni yo ko gbogbo-gbogbo ni. Ayo otu wa shonu ohobu ko obe, kweyi kamo,<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />Adole kpo Owuso ka! Awo gye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">ko nyi igyashi, abokpa, kpo oshu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">Koni awo pini ya awoza kpiri la,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">kweyi bwebe kimu wo pini ababa ki gbo olayi la.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s">Okpa kpo Oyi ko Otukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Nmo okpa ko Owuso abore kase ni yagye obe ni; ogbe enena agbabo pepa, kweyi ayoba kpo oba ahapa. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Kweyi nmo oyoleho nyakwu, ni ya tono kpoko nyakwu ni mo, &lt;&lt;Anoho gye koyo oba mani gwa shini ona gwokpa ko Owuso?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Ashishe ke yaba lo, iso kwo okpagye kwa alekwu ko gwokpa shini ana mipu nu. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Nkyegba kotata ikweyi koni npyase ni gye ko gwokpa mani ko moza ni yipu nu ni lo. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Ashe ipu ka anyakwase ka dami mo, &lt;&lt;Ka kyegba lo. Ma! Abaga ki ipwoma ko Ojuda, ni wo oyi nyakwu ki ipwoma ko Odawuda ni, orogwa wa, oya gege yayo oba ahapa mani yi fo kweyi gwokpa ko Owuso.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Ebeni nmo Oyi ko Otukpo hagye otutehe ko obe, kpa awobize ni gbo olayi ni ene kpa awanyakwase ene shogba to. Oyi ko Otukpo mani lebyo oni akwobonu yi ngmo ni. Ogbo agyi ahapa kpi iyi ahapa, ni wo omaku ahapa ko Owuso ni atoleho wese mani kpiri ni. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Oyi ko Otukpo mani ga zokpa abore kase ni yagye obe ni. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Ni oya mani ni, ebe ni gbo olayi ni ene kpa awanyakwase awepa ayene kwagye ohobu ko Oyi ko Otukpo mani. Ananoho wa byo okuburu kpo owatu ko ozinariya nwonwu kpo ozakpehe, ni wi inarigwu kase ko Owuso. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Awigye pepe mo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">&lt;&lt;Ogye kozo okpa ko Owuso mani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">kweyi yawo oba nu fo sho gwokpa ko Owuso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">Koni ayo ngmo, kweyi bwebe kikwu wo, obya ase webe ko Owuso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">ase bwo ose gogo-gogo, igbenu, okpagye kpe edo kasuse kpiri.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Oyuwa wo obula ka awosapa ko geyagye do Owuso ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">kweyi aba kpogwu kese.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Nki mebe, kweyi npwoko ka ayoleho, okpakwu kpi ikpokyo nwashika! Ahagye shogba to obe, kpo obize ene kpa awanyakwase, <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />kweyi awigye kpoko nyakwu mo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">&lt;&lt;Oyi ko Otukpo ko Owuso ni ayi ngmo ni gye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">ko zo oshu, odu, oziyi, kpo oshu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">abokpa, igyashi kpiye shosha!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Kweyi npwe eya ko oza ni ayuwa iso, kpe ese, kpa alekwu kpipu kishu kpo oza ni gbo olayi ese mani kpiri ba wigye mo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">&lt;&lt;Iye shosha kpa abokpa, igyashi kpo oshu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">wa kase ni yo obe ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">ko gbogbo-gbogbo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Awo oza ene ni gbo olayi mani kyogwu mo,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 5:14">&lt;&lt;Nalemani!&gt;&gt; Kweyi awanyakwase kwagye kweyi ageyagye.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s">Awoba ko Opunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Ebeni nmo Oyi ko Otukpo gwoba kikyikyo ipu ka ahapa ni, kweyi npwo oye ipu ka awoza ni gbo olayi mani kela byeya ka akpula ni kamo, &lt;&lt;Wa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Nshoko kweyi nmo onya nehe. Ino sonya mani byo ota, adano otu. Obose bya ase ni ya kpefu ko refu.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Ebeni Oyi ko Otukpo ko gwoba ko omwepa; kweyi npwo oza ni gbo olayi ko omwepa kamo, &lt;&lt;Wa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Onya oye nowa ki bose. Adase ni ya sonya mani oshu ko byefu wese, shini ase na ngmiyiwa. Adanu ewakpa nyakwu.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Ebeni Oyi ko Otukpo gwoba ko omweta; kweyi npwo oza ni gbo olayi ko omweta kamo, &lt;&lt;Wa!&gt;&gt; Nshoko nmo onya nobi. Ino sonya mani byoza ko myizire abo nu. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Npwoje byo oko ka awoza ene ni gbo olayi ni kamo, &lt;&lt;Owatu kewo ni wa abola koko wo ke eno oye, kweyi owatu eta ka ahunkpa wa abola koko wo ke eno oye. Ala ka ya ano kpi inyi yishi lo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Oyi ko Otukpo kyi gwoba ko omene; Npwo oza ni gbo olayi ko omene kamo, &lt;&lt;Wa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Nshoko nmo onya oye inyi-kayi. Ase ni sonya mani ayogwu mi Ikwu kpa Alekwu, ya gboso itikpi. Ada awoshu ikweyi ko okwu oye ipu ki igwo kase kese mani, ko yuwa ngmo bwebe kefu kpokpo, emye, ose gogo-gogo kpa awobekwu. <verse eid="REV 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Oyi ko Otukpo gwoba ko omeho. Nmo omaku kawase ni ayuwa ngmo ikweyi koni atono kela ko Owuso kpo okwokwoshi ni beye ko okpe. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Awomaku mani ngmegba kpoko nyakwu mo, &lt;&lt;Adole Ine koshu kpiri, ase neshi kpi ine kokwokwoshi! Ishinya ome ni oya kwese epwo kweyi gbuwogo agye koni ayaha ngmo ni?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Adawo omaku mani oshiye nehe ko shoko, kweyi aka dawa mo ana minyo gbayayi ome, gbishini awomonyekwotu ya ayole kpa awogboso kpiri ni ashu ko ngmo ni yi ngmo kweyi ome.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Nmo Oyi ko Otukpo gwoba ko omwihiri. Okpagye ja kotota, kweyi eno pya tobi tiri bya akyi nobi ni, oya pya gola yo byo oyi ni. <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />Awinyiwo shonu okpagye byo ogwogwa ko kefu ni zelo shonu okpagye ishi ni owu loshu tani. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Akpa gebi bya ayokpa ko Owuso la ni, efu kpiri kpagye kpiri ni inyo shogba toni shebe ni abanu ni bita. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Ebeni awose kese, awoteyi kpawo kpogwu ka adakare, awolodu kpa awine koshu, kpa ashini kase kpiri, awoshe kawase ni woshe lo ni, yiyiwa teba owu ko okpo iso kefu. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Angmegba yefu kpi ikyikpo ogwu kamo, &lt;&lt;Gbo saha kweyi yaha teba shiyi kase ni yagye obe kpa anya ko Oyi ko Otukpo oni! <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />Kokwokwoshi eno ka nya wa yoma! Owuso kpo Oyi ko Oyi ko Otukpo ba sayi ka anya wa, ananoho ya gege ko wobi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s">Ase ki Izrayila okpakwu ogbogbo oye sawene ayene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Itikpi ko mani nma ayoleho ko Owuso ene hagye agbabo ene kese, ayowu gogo-gogo ene yi gbo tagye shini owu naka ta ese kwi ishu, kwe efu oyoye lo. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Nki mo oyoleho oye yawa bwa ahanokyi kpo oba kofunu ko Owuso ine kolayi. Oya ayoleho ko Owuso ene ogwu kpoko nwaa, awa ni adawoshu ko yokpagye kpishu yishi ni. <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />Oyoleho oni kamo, &lt;&lt;Ka yokpagye kwishu kwefu ofo kpowu wa lo, gbishini amya ayoleho ko Owuso oyi ogo wa imbe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Aka dami mase ni ayoleho ko Owuso myuwoyi ogo ni wase okpakwu ogbogbo oye sawene ayene. Abwipu ka awipwoma igwepa ki Izrayila, <verse eid="REV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Ase okpakwu igwepa bwi ipwoma ko Ojuda, ase okpakwu igwepa bwi ipwoma ko Oruben, ase okpakwu igwepa bwi ipwoma ko Ogadi, <verse eid="REV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />ase okpakwu igwepa bwi ipwoma ko Asha, ase okpakwu igwepa bwi ipwoma ko Onaftali, ase okpakwu igwepa bwi ipwoma ko Omanase, <verse eid="REV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />ase okpakwu igwepa bwi ipwoma ko Osimiyo, ase okpakwu igwepa bwi ipwoma ko Olawi, ase okpakwu igwepa bwi ipwoma ki Isasha, <verse eid="REV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />ase okpakwu igwepa bwi ipwoma ko Ozebulu, ase okpakwu igwepa bwi ipwoma ki Isu, ase okpakwu igwepa bwi ipwoma ko Obejami.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ewa Nwashika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Itikpi ko omani nme ewa kasuse ni ashishe ya gege ya ka lo ni! Abwokpagye, ose, kpi igbenu wonyonya kpikpo kase gogo-gogo, kweyi ahagye ohobu ko obe kpo Oyi ko Otukpo, asho oshiye nehe, abyo okwari abo wa. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />Kweyi ayogwu kpoko nyakwu mo: &lt;&lt;Ongmongma bwebe ko Owuso ka, anu ni yagye obe ni, kweyi ki bwebe ko Oyi ko Otukpo nu!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Ayoleho kpiri hagye shogba to obe, awanyakwase, kpo oza ene ni gbo olayi ni. Agbo agye yiyi wa ka agye obutu ko obe kweyi ba geyagye do Owuso, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />akamo, &lt;&lt;Nalemani! Iye shosha, igyashi, oziyi, otunehe, abokpa, oshu, kpo ogege wako Owuso ko gbogbo gbogbo! Nalemani!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Anyakwase oye dumoka mo, &lt;&lt;Awanoho sho oshiye nehe mani, abwini wa?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />&lt;&lt;Nkamo, ngye lo adole, ogye&gt;&gt;.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:14">Oka dami mo, &lt;&lt;Awase ni bose bwipu kegye ko Okristi kotata ni oma. Ayo oshiye wa na kweyi yuwa shehe ipu koyi ko Oyi ko Otukpo. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Ozani yuwa hagye obutu ko obe ko Owuso ba geyagye danu ke eno kotu okpe nu ni oma. Anu ni yagye obe ni ya gbuwa gbogbo kpo obowu nu. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Aba ngmemye kwi igyini kelo; eno ya suwa lo, akpowu kola ya pwuwa lo, <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />ikweyi koni Oyi ko Otukpo, niyo otutehe ko obe ni, yawo inogbeho wa, oya kpuwogwu gokpa olayi. Kweyi Owuso ya wuwize iyi.&gt;<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s">Oba ko Omwahapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Ishini Oyi ko Otukpo gwoba ko omwahapa ni, iso sha din ko kepa kishi. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Ebeni nma ayoleho ko Owuso ahapa hagye obutu nu, kweyi adawa ajigwo ahapa.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Oyoleho ko Owuso oye ni gba ake ko ozinariya ni aba shoza kpehe ni, wa hagye okpe. Adanu oza kpehe nwashika shini na fayi kpi inarigwu kase ko Owuso kpiri, ikweyi ko okpe ko ozinariya ni yo obutu ko obe ni. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Iwola koza kpehe ni ya yola ni gi iso kpi inarigwu kase ko Owuso ni bwabo ko oyoleho ni hagye obutu ko Owuso ni. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Ebeni oyoleho zake koza kpehe, ofola bwo okpe mani nwo, kweyi ta wese. Ebebeni owusogbo, akpula gbo, owusotasha kweyi agye ja.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ajigwo Ahapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Kweyi ayoleho ko Owuso ahapa ni bya ajigwo ahapa ni kwotu ko ta ajigwo.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Oyoleho kikyikyo ta ajigwo nu. Akyo ki inyo, ola nyabo kpo oyi bwi iso shonu okpagye. Okwu oye ipu ke eta kese yola, okwu oye ipu ke eta kefu kpa ashi meme wonyonya yola kpiri.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Ebeni oyoleho ko omwepa ta ajigwo nu. Otoje ni lebye efu nyakwu ya kyola gipu ki ishu, okwu oye ipu ke eta ki ishu pya woyi, <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />okwu oye ipu ke eta ka awoza ni bipu ki ishu ni gekwu, okwu oye ipu ke eta ka awowu ki inyo kya ipu ki ishu.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Kweyi oyoleho ko omweta ta ajigwo nu. Inyiwo gyokwu ya yu bye emu, fa bwi iso wa gbo ikweyi ko okwu oye ipu ke eta ka awishu kpo okpa ki inyo. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />(Iye ki inyiwo mani wo &lt;&lt;Olono.&gt;&gt;) Agbabo ki inyo ni pya lono, ase nwashika ni gwinyo mani gekwu, ikweyi koni opya lono ni.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Ebeni oyoleho ko omene ta ajigwo nu. Oye ipu ke eta ke eno kpo oya kpi inyiwo yishi, oye ipu ke eta ko yoyu wa dibu; oye ipu ke eta ke eno kpo otu pya webe dibu. <verse eid="REV 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Ebeni nshoko nmeto ya wu iso, ya kela kpo oko nyakwu kamo, &lt;&lt;Ebi! Ebi! Ebi mani ya lemoji dase kese, ishini ashini ka ayoleho eta wa ta ajigwo wa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Kweyi oyoleho ko omeho ta ajigwo nu. Nmi inyiwo oye gbo okpagye, kweyi adano oba ko gwogo ni gbomeyi lo ni. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Inyiwo gwogo oni, kweyi iwola bose bwanu, lebyi iwola ko ola ni ya kye mla-mla; iwola ko ogo mani yo oyoyu ke eno kpo owu dibu. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Awihima bose bwipu ki iwola wese, adawo oshu ko sase byena. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Aka dawa mo anaka ya akyashi kwe efu kpa ashini koza ni ba bwu ni ojije lo; awase ni ke gbo oyi ko Owuso ogo wa lo ni kin pini aba yuwofo la. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Ada awihima mani oshu ko ngmase lo, ake ba dase owe kin la koya eho. Owe ni aba dase ni ya duwose byo osose kena. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Ipu koya eho mani, aba labo kikwu, ake bapye lo; aba yimu ko gekwu, ikwu ke ya ngmuwa lo.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Awihima mani lebya awonya ni wiyiwashu ko gefu kpokpo ni; ikweyi wa gbo oje lebyo otu ko ozinariya, ahiyiwa lebya akasuse. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Inyeyi wa lebyi inyeyi kanya, ahanu wa lebya ahanu ka abaga. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Awihima mani koje ni lebyo oshiye kogye otuwa, eya kakya wa lebye eya ko ozakobiyo ni onya nwashika pyi kpe enya ba gokwunu kefu ni. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Agbewa kweyi ba sase byena ni, agboshu ko sase kpe ewa koya eho. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Awihima mani gbo ose ni ya kpuwa ogwu ni, anu wo oyoleho ni woteyi ko ogo ni gbomeyi lo ni. Iyenu ipu ki igbenu ko Ibru wo, Abadon; ipu ki igbenu ko Ogirik wo Apoliyon (asenu wo &lt;&lt;Ino ngmase.&gt;&gt;)<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Ebi kikyikyo shigbo; itikpi ko mani, ebi epa ki bawa.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Ebeni oyoleho ko omwihiri ta ajigwo nu. Npwoko bwo agbabo ene ko okpe ko ozinariya ni hagye obutu ko Owuso ni. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Oko mani kela do oyoleho ko omwihiri mo, &lt;&lt;Sha ayoleho ene ni ayuwa gbo ishu nyakwu ki Ifretus ni bita!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Ake sha ayoleho ene mani bita; ayuwa shagye ba gbeyi kishi mani, eno mani, oya mani kpi ishayi mani koga ngmo okwu oye ipu ke eta kase kese mani kpiri. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Akewa kadakare mani dami: awi ikpokyo ogbogbo epa. <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Ipu ko oza ni asayi dami ni, nma awonya kpa awino suwa: agbo oshiye kogye nowa botu wa byo ola, awinyi ketu ni kwu neneshi byo okpo ni gba akwekye, winyi kayi bye ehola. Ikweyi ka awonya mani lebyikweyi ka abaga, kweyi ola, iwola kpe ehola ba bose okwunu wa. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Awebi eta mani yo okwu oye ipu ke eta ka asuse yi ngmo: ola, iwola kpe ehola ni ba bose okwunu ka awonya ni. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Oshu kawo onya mani yo okwunu wa kpo ewa wa. Ewa wa lebyikweyi ke egwa, aba yoko kpanu ba yase ofo. <verse eid="REV 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Ashini kasuse, ni gekwu kebi mani lo ni, kwikyikye ni ashagbotu ko sho ozalabi wa bita lo. Agohobu ko geyagye do omaku bibi, kpe eka ko ozinariya kpa azurupa, ogye-fufuku kpa akyo, kpefu, ni ba mebe lo, aba pwaha kwe ba yawu lo. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Kwikyikyeni ashagbotu ko ngmase lo, ba ya abodiyi ba beba, ba wi.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s">Oyoleho kpo Okpa Leke</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Ebeni nmo oyoleho nyakwu bwi iso yawo okpagye. Akpa yogwu kweyi owusoshogwa para ikweyi nu; ahiyi nu lebye eno, ikpo nu lebyi ite kola. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Ogbo okpa leke gwowa yabo nu. Oyikpo nu ka abore hi ikweyi ki ishu. Ikpo ka aboshe oyi ho okpagye, <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />kweyi oyogwu kpo oko nyakwu bya ka awabaga. Ni oyogwu ni akpula ahapa kyogwu kpo oko loshu loshu. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Ishini akpula ahapa mani kela ni, nyyimu ko yi ta. Nke pwoko kela bwi iso mo, &lt;&lt;Yo oza ni akpula ahapa kani yi teba; kayi ta lo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Ebeni oyoleho ni nmo hagye ikweyi ki ishu kpo okpagye ni za abore nu iso <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />ogwene kpiye ko Owuso, ni yaba ko gbogbo-gbogbo, ni yi iso kpo okpagye, kpi ishu kpa awoza kpiri ni bipu wa ni. Oyoleho kamo, &lt;&lt;Oya gbeji kelo! <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Ishini oyoleho ko omwahapa ke ta ajigwo ni, Owuso ya ngmeyi ko oko ni oyi teba koya ni, byo ni okada ayole nu kawo bane ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Ebeni oko ni npwo bwi iso ni ya kela kpami ni ki kamo, &lt;&lt;Ga zokpa ni gwogwa ni yabo ko oyoleho ni hagye ipu ki ishu kpe ega ki ishu ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Ngebe ko oyoleho ga kadanu mo ona dami okpa leke. Oka dami mo, &lt;&lt;Ze sho oha; oya wowa ipu wo, okwunu wo ke oya lonye bye eyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Nzo okpa leke ni abo nu kweyi ha, oke lonye bye eyi okwunu hin. Itikpi koni nyyi me ni ke, opya wowa ipu hin. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Ebeni Oyoleho kadami mo, &lt;&lt;Kwikyikyeni owotiri ko tono kela ko Owuso da awokpagye, ase nwashika kpa awigbenu kpe edo kasuse kpa awose.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s">Awolobene Epa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Adami okposhi ni lebyo okposhi ko myo oza kweyi aka dami mo, &lt;&lt;Ga myo ole ko Owuso kpo okpe nu kweyi yawo geyagye ni bo ole ko Owuso ni yika. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Ka ke mya akpada kese lo, ikweyi koni Owuso yi da awase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni, aba woteyi ko Ogya Neshi hin ko oya awene ayepa. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Nyya ta awolobene hin epa ni shoshiye ka ashisha ni oleho, aba tono kela ko Owuso ipu ka aweno okpakwu oye sogbogbo epa sawihiri mani.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Awolobene epa mani wefu ko ozetu epa kpi ikwomu epa ni hagye obutu ka Adole kese ni. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Owoni ashe takirikwu ko yuwo ofo, ola ya bwo okwunu wa yaya awomonyekwotu wa ayi; mani oni ase ni takirikwu ko yuwo ofo kpiri aba yuwa ngmo. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Awolobene epa mani gboshu ko ya akpa gwu, shini owuso naka wa lo ishini aba tono kela ko Owuso. Aki gboshu ikweyi ki inyo ko okpa, ko pyanu woyi; aki gboshu ko bye ebi wonyonya wese ishi kpiri ni ayimu ni.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Ishini atono kela wa kweyi ni, obekwu oye bose ipu ko ogo ni gbomeyi lo ni wa guwotu konu. Oshunu ya shakawa kweyi yuwa ngmo, <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />kweyi okwu ka awolobene mani ba shagye owe ipu ko ogya nyakwu, ebeni aya Adole wa poshi ni. Ase kiye ko ogya mani wo Osodom kwi Ijip. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Ase bwo okpagye, kpo ose, kpi igbenu kpiri ebebe nya bawa mo okwu wa ke eno eta kpo oshishini, kweyi aba kyogwu shini ana yuwa nyi lo. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Ase kese ba shotunehe ikweyi kikwu ka awolobene epa mani. Aba shotunehe kweyi keshi diyiwa, ikweyi koni awobane epa mani byo owe wa dase kese kpiri. <verse eid="REV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Itikpi ke eno eta kpo oshishini olayi niya dase olayi bwebe ko Owuso wa gipu wa kweyi, atakpa nyiso; kpiri kase ni muwa ni oshi yuwa kwu kotata. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Awobane epa mani pwoko nwa bwi iso ya ka dawa mo, &lt;&lt;Webe ni!&gt;&gt; Ishini awomonyekwotu wa ba muwa ni abwipu ka akpa gi iso. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Ebebeni okpagye ja kotata; ikpo oye ipu ko okwu igwo ko ogya nyakwu ni wogya nyakwu mani kya, kweyi ngmase okpakwu ahapa. Oshi ya ashini kase kwu kweyi asho Owuso nyakwu ki iso iye.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Ebi ko omwepa shigbo, oke ya gbeji lo ebi ko omweta ki yawa!<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ajigwo ko Omwahapa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Ebeni oyoleho ko omwahapa ta ajigwo nu, kweyi apwawoko nwa bwi iso ba kamo, &lt;&lt;Anani oshu ko kpogwu kese waka Adole ka kpo Omezaya nu, oya kpogwu ko gbogbo-gbogbo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Ebeni awanyakwase awepa ayene ni bagye obe wa ni kwagye obutu ko Owuso ba geyagye danu, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />aba kamo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">&lt;&lt;Adole Owuso Ine koshu kpiri, ase ni we ki kwobonu we ni!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">Ashotunehe dawo ni oyo oshu nyakwu wo bize ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">oki kwotu ko okpogwu!<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Awase ni gyo Owuso lo ni ba wotu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">ikweyi koni ishi ka anya kyokye wo gye wa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">ishi ko kepwo kawase ni gekwu ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Ishi gye ko da ayole wo kawo bane abola wa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">kpawase sere wo kpiri, ni ba yoshi wo ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">bwa anyakwu wo oleke.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Ishi gye wa koni oya yawase ni yese yishi ni yi ngmo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Ole ko Owuso gwogwa iso, amo Odudu ko Okoyi ipu ko Ole ko Owuso. Owusotasha, kpe eya ka akpula, akpula gbo, agyeja kweyi owuso yiwo ka akyo nyakwu-nyakwu.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s">Onya kpe Egwa Nyakwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Ebeni oyi ki igbashi nyakwu oye bose akpa. Onya oye bose akpa ni sho oshiye ke eno kweyi yi ikpo nu so oya kpo otu ni gbi inyiwo igwepa ni ikweyi nu. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Okwagye koma, kweyi odose kpo owe koma yo sheha.<verse eid="REV 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Oza ki igbashi nyakwu oye ki bose akpa. Egwa nyakwu nowa ni aba yogwu mo &lt;&lt;Odragon ni&gt;&gt; gbi ikweyi ahapa kpa agyi igwo kpo otu ahapa ka awikweyi kpiri. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Opyo oye ipu ko okwu eta ka awinyiwo ni ba akpa ni kpe ewa nu wa shonu ese. Ohagye ohobu ko onya ni kwagye koma ni, shini owoni oya moyi ona yo oyi ni oma ni yi me. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Ebeni onya ni moyi nongo, ni ya wa kpogwu kese ni kpiri kpo oshu. Ake yo oyi mani nusho ga yi do Owuso kpo obe nu. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Onya mani nyinya nu gi ipu ko ododa, ebeni Owuso kyanutu danu ni, ebeni aba yi iyi kwo ke eno okpakwu oye so ogbogbo epa sawihiri ni.<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Ebeni efu kpokpo nyiso ipu ki iso. Omakyel kpa ayoleho nu kpefu kpe egwa nyakwu kpa ayole nu mama ni; <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />efu ke ye egwa nyakwu mani yi re, kweyi kanu ka ayole nu ashuwa bita bi iso kelo. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Ate egwa nyakwu mani gagye, egwa nekye-nekye ni aba yogwu mi Ibiri kwo Obibi ni gye ese kpiri egya ni. Ato gbo okpagye, anu kpa ayole nu.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Ebeni npwo oko nwa bwi iso mo, &lt;&lt;Anani ongmongma ko Owuso wa! Anani Owuso sayi ko oshu nu byo Ose! Anani Omezaya nu sayi ko oshu nu! Koni ase ni hagye obutu ko Owuso ka kweyi ya gbela sa awogboso ke eno ko otu ni ato bwiso wese. <verse eid="REV 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Arogwa ikweyi nu bwebe ko oyi ko Oyi ko Otukpo kpo okwokwoshi ni ato ono ni; kweyi agbi imu ko zo olayi wa shini ana gekwu. <verse eid="REV 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Mani oni iso, kpase ni bipu nu kpiri na shotunehe! Ikweyi koni Ibiri wokpagye wa tala, kweyi onwonwu kpanya, ikweyi koni ogye mo ishi ni ogbo ni shishini nwa kelo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Ishini egwa nyakwu mani gye mo ato gagye ni, okwotu ko sonya ni moyi nongo mani enya. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Adonya mani akya ke eto nyakwu epa ni oyawu gebe ko oyagye nu ipu ko ododa, ebeni aba yiyi kwo ka ashayi eta soya ihiri, shini egwa nyakwu naka yofo lo. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Ebeni egwa nyakwu mani gbagba ki inyo ni kye bwo okwunu nu ko yo onya mani re. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Okpagye ke to onya mani abo; kweyi gwo okwunu yi inyo ni shonu bwo okwunu ke egwa nyakwu mani yi gwa. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Egwa nyakwu mani kyanya kotata kpo onya mani kweyi ga kpefu kpi ipwoma ko onya mani kpiri, kpase kpiri ni geyagye do ono ko Owuso kweyi gbotuse kokwokwoshi ni Oyesu sayi ni. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Kweyi egwa nyakwu hagye ega ki ishu.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s">Obekwu Epa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Ebeni nmo obekwu bose bwi ipu ki ishu. Ogbo agyi igwo kpi ikweyi ahapa; ikweyi kagyi nu kpiri gbo otu, ikweyi nu gbiye ni ya so Owuso esa ni. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Obekwu ni nma ni lema bye egye, ikpo nu lebya ki iwashi, okwunu nu lebya ka abaga. Egwa nyakwu do obekwu oshu nu, obe nu, kpo oshu nyakwu. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Ikweyi ko obekwu oye ya byo ogba akrigya, akrigya mani ke ze. Igbashi ya ase kese kpiri kwu kweyi agboso obekwu nyakwu mani. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Ananoho geyagye de egwa nyakwu ikweyi koni oyo oshu nu yi do obekwu. Mamani ageyagye do obekwu kamo, &lt;&lt;Anoho lebyo obekwu? Anoho agege ya nonu kpanu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Owuso sho obekwu bita ya gboshu komo Owuso nye, ashobita gboshu ki ishayi eta so oya ihiri. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Oya yo Owuso okwunu, iye nu, ebeni oya nu ni, kpa awase ni biso kpiri ni. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Ashobita ya gbapwo kpo ase ko Owuso kweyi gwuwa agye, Adanu oshu ikweyi ka awose kpiri, okpagye, igbenu kpe edo kase gogo gogo. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Ase kese kpiri ba geyagye danu, awase ni ba geyagye lo ni kin pi ni wa awase ni Owuso ti iye wa ipu ko okpa ko olayi imbe ayese. Okpa mani wako oyi ko Otukpo ni ayi ngmo ni.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />&lt;&lt;Ase ni gba akpaha ona pwo! <verse eid="REV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Ase ni wako yi kwu, aba yo kwu; ase ni wa ko yi ngmo kpe ewakpa, aba yi ngmo kpe ewakpa. Omani wiyawu ko ozotu kpo otuse ebe kase ko Owuso.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Kweyi nki mo obekwu oye, ni bose wese. Ogba agyi epa byo agyi ko oyi ko Otukpo, kweyi oya kela byo egwa nyakwu. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Oyo oko kpo oshu nyakwu ko obekwu kikyikyo obutu nu. Obye ese koshu kpase ni bipu nu ni kpiri ko geyagye do obekwu kikyikyo ni akrigya nu ze wa. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Obekwu ko omwepa mani ya awoza kigbashi nyakwu; oyo ola wokpagye bwi iso iyi ka anano. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Ogya awase kese kpiri egya bwebe ka awigbashi ni ayo ya obutu ko obekwu kikyikyo ni. Obekwu ka da awase kese mo ana moyi ka abokpa do obekwu ni gba akrigya ke ewakpa ni kwikyikyeni oke gekwu lo ni. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Asho obekwu ko omwepa bita ko showu ko olayi to oyi ko obekwu kikyikyo, shini na kela kweyi na ngma wase kpiri ni tela ko geyagye danu ni. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Obekwu byase koshu, anyakwase kpa ayi leke, olodu kpo oleha, awoshe kpase ni wo oshe lo kpiri ba gbe enena abore wa kpo ogo wa. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Ashishe ya roza kwe ya tora ko oza kelo, owoni gbe enena mani lo, iye ko obekwu kwe enena ni hagye ikweyi ki iye nu.<verse eid="REV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Omani so ogbo oziyi ome oya gye enena ko obekwu mani la! Owoni gbo okyo oya gye enena ko obekwu mani, ikweyi koni enena mani wi iye kashe la. Enena mani wi ihiri, ihiri, ihiri (666).<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s">Oyi ko Otukpo kpa Ase nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Ebeni nshoko kweyi nmo, Oyi ko Otukpo hagye Efu ko Osiyona; ase okpakwu ogbogbo oye sawene ayene ni atiye nu kpa aka Ada nu ogo wa. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Kweyi npwoko bwi iso ni ya yeya byo inyo ni ya pe, byeya ka akpula. Oya yeya byi igye ni ayi ki igye ba wo kpo okwuburu wa ni. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Ase okpakwu ogbogbo oye sawene ayene kpa awanyakwase, kpo oza ene ni gbo olayi ni, hagye ohobu ko obe. Aba wigye pepe ni awa fufuwa kin ba gishi kowo la, ipu kase kese kpiri awa ni Owuso ngmawa ni. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Awase ni yi iyiwa tagye neshi, akyogwu ko kya kpa anya lo; akwi iyiwa. Agboso Oyi ko Otukpo ge ebe kpiri ni oya ga. Ayuwa ngma sha ashini kase kese, kweyi awa kikyikyo ni ayuwa do Owuso kpo Oyi ko Otukpo ni. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Agyuwa kpo okame lo; agbepwo oyoye lo.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayoleho Eta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Ebeni nmoyoleho oye yawu iso, kpo Oshu Neshi ni wa ko gbogbo ni ko ka dase kese, awikpo ko ose kpiri, ose kpiri, igbenu kpiri kpo okpagye kpiri. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />Oka kpo oko nyakwu kamo, &lt;&lt;Geyagye do Owuso kweyi sho okwunu iye! Ikweyi koni ishi gye wa ko kepwo ikweyi kase kpiri. Geyagye do ase ni yiso, kpo okpagye, kpi ishu, kpo okpa ni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Oyoleho ko omwepa gbosa kikyikyo kweyi mo, &lt;&lt;Ogbo wa! Okpagye nyakwu ko Obabila gbo wa! Kweyi oyase kpiri gwinyi nu, inyi loshu kimu ke eba boba nu!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Oyoleho ko omweta gbosa ayoleho epa ni ga ni, kweyi ka kpo oko nyakwu mo, &lt;&lt;Awase ni geyagye do obekwu kpo oyi nu kweyi apyenena ogo wa kwa abo wa <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />awa abiyiwa ba gwinyi ko Owuso, inyi ka anya nu, ni oshonu shipu ka abwa ka anya nu kpiri ni! Kpiri kase ni yoza mani aba dawowe ipu kola kpo ehola ohobu ko ayoleho neshi kpo Oyi ko Otukpo. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Iwola kola ni dawowe ni ya giso ko gbogbo-gbogbo. Awase ni geyagye do obekwu mani kpo oyi nu ni kpa awase ni amyuwoyi kiye nu ni gbo ominyo lo ke eno ko otu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Omani ya sayi ma ase ko Owuso na zotu, awase ni gboso ono ko Owuso ki gbo okwokwoshi do Oyesu ni. <verse eid="REV 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Ebeni npwo oko bwi iso ya kamo, &lt;&lt;Yoza mani ta: Otunehe yo kpa awase ni gekwu ipu ka Adole bwanani gohobu!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:13">Omaku ko Owuso kamo, &lt;&lt;Olema kwokwoshi! Aba minyo koko wa, ikweyi koni oko wa ya gbosuwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Izire Kyokye Kese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Ebeni nshoko, nma akpa nehe, oza ni yagye akpa mani lebya asuse, kpo otu ko ozinariya ikweyi nu kpo okege rore yabo nu. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Ebeni oyoleho oye bose bwo ole ko Owuso, kweyi kyegba kpo oko nwa dase ni yagye akpa mani ni mo, &lt;&lt;Yoko kpo okege wo shini ogwi izire, ikweyi koni ishi gye wa; ishi ko kyi izire kese!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Ebeni ase ni yagye ikweyi ka akpa ni to okege nu gipu kese, kweyi yese gwu.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Ebeni nmo oyoleho oye ki bose bwo ole ko Owuso iso, ogbo okege rore mamani. <verse eid="REV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Ebeni oyoleho oye, ni gboshu ikweyi kola ni, bwo okpe yawa. Ongmegba kpo oko nwa do oyoleho ni byo okege rore ni mo, &lt;&lt;Yoko kpo okege wo shini wogwogwa keho kese, ikweyi koni oze ko gwu wa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Ebeni oyoleho oye, to okege nu gipu kese, okyi izire bwe eho, kweyi otuwa gipu kebe ni aba pyi inyi ka anya ko Owuso. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Apyo ogwogwa kefu bwebe ko pyi inyi wese ko ogya nyakwu, kweyi oyi bose ebeni aba pyi inyi mani, igbo ko pope koyi mani wo ogbogbo epa kweyi olibu nu lebyo ikpo eho.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s">Ayoleho ni Bya Awebi ko Gwejeji ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Ebeni nmo oza ki igbashi oye nyakwu ipu ka akpa. Ayoleho ahapa kpe ebi ahapa ni wa ko gwejeji ni, ikweyi koni owanya ko gwejeji ni Owuso ya ya ni. <verse eid="REV 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Ebeni nmo oje lebyi ishu ki iyimebe nyabo kpo ola. Nki mawase ni rogwa ikweyi ko obekwu kpo oyi nu kpase ni oza koka hagye okwunu kiye nu ni. Ahagye agbabo ki ishu, abyo okwuburu ni Owuso da awa ni, <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />kweyi aba wigye ko Omusa, oyole ko Owuso, kpi igye ko Oyi ko Otukpo mo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">&lt;&lt;Adole Owuso Ine koshu kpiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">oko wo shoshi ki gyokwu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Ose ka awokpagye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">owe wo ogyogye ki gbo okwokwoshi!<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Adole anoho ya yoshi wo lo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">Anoho ya gege ya tanu ko ki igyashi wo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">Ikweyi koni awo fufo pini wa ase neshi la.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Awokpagye kpiri bawa hagye obutu wo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">kweyi ba geyagye dawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">ikweyi koni ananoho mo oko neshi wo ni oya ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Itikpi ko mani nmo ole ko Owuso gwogwa ipu ki iso, kpa Adaba Neshi ipu nu. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Ayoleho ahapa ni gbebi ahapa ni bose bwipu kole ko Owuso, asho opa neshi ni ya yu ni kpo ogbogbo ko ozinariya gbotu wa. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Ebeni oye ipu ka awoza ni gbo olayi ene mani da ayoleho ahapa ake ahapa ko ozinariya nwu kpa anya ko Owuso, ni yo ko gbogbo-gbogbo. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Ole ko Owuso nwu kpi iwola bwi igyashi kpo oshu ko Owuso, kweyi ashishe ya gipu kole ko Owuso lo, gbishini ebi ahapa ni ayoleho ahapa biwa mani kweyi.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s">Awake Kanya ko Owuso <note caller="+" style="fe"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bowls of the Anger of God</char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Ebeni npwo oko nwa ya kela bwo ole ko Owuso da ayoleho ahapa mo, &lt;&lt;Ga yo owatu ahapa kanya ko Owuso mani yi pyashu shese!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Oyoleho kikyikyo gaya akakanu pyashu sho ese. Akrigya labi ni ya dose kotata ni bose ikpiye kawase ni gbe enena ko obekwu kpa awase ni ba geyagye do oyi nu ni. <verse eid="REV 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Ebeni oyoleho ko omwepa ya akakanu pyashu shi ishu. Inyo pya lebyo oyi kase ni gekwu ni, awoza ni gbo olayi ipu ki ishu kpiri ni gekwu.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Ebeni oyoleho ko omweta ya akakanu pyashu sho awokpa, kpi ibwu, kweyi inyo pya woyi. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Npwo oyoleho ni gboshu ikweyi ki inyo ni kamo, &lt;&lt;Epwo ni oka mani wokwokwoshi, owase neshi, awo ni we, ki kwobonu we ni! <verse eid="REV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Ayo oyi kase ko Owuso kpa awobane yi shonu, ni olemani oni, odawo oyi ma anagwa. Apyo oza ni aba tikpo ni!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Ebeni npwoko bwo okpe kamo, &lt;&lt;Adole Owuso Ine koshu kpiri! Epwo wo wokwokwoshi!<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Oyoleho ko omene ya akakanu pyashu she eno, kweyi asho okwola nu bita ya yase byo ola ni. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Akpowu kola nyakwu yuwa yi, ayiye ko Owuso okwunu ni gboshu ikweyi kebi mani. Ake tela ko shagbotu sho ozalabi wa shini ana shi igyashi nu iye.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Ebeni oyoleho ko omeho pyashu kakanu bwa ake sho obe ko obekwu. Ebedibu yo obula ko obekwu yi gwu, kweyi ase ba hahanu wa ikweyi ko dose nu, <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />kweyi ayo Owuso ki iso okwunu ikweyi ko dose kpa akrigya wa. Ake shagbotu ko ozalabi wa lo.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Ebeni oyoleho ko omwihiri ya kakanu pyashu bwa ake sho okpa ki Ifretus. Ishu ngmo, shini ana gwo owe da awose ni bawa bwa ahanokyi ni. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Ebeni nma awomaku bibi eta ni le bya akrifo ni. Aba bose bwo okwunu ke egwa nyakwu, okwunu ko obekwu, kpo okwunu ki inobane ko kame.<verse eid="REV 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Awomaku bibi ni ba yawoza kigbashi ni. Awomaku eta mani ba bose gebe kawo ose kese kpiri, ko kpi ikweyi wa gbayikweyi kefu ke eno nyakwu ko Owuso Ine ko Oshu kpiri.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />&lt;&lt;Ala pwo! Nyya wa byo owi! Otunehe yo kpase ni yiyi kweyi ba gbeho ko oshiye wa ni, shini ana ka yawu ewewa kweyi yiweyi ipu kase lo!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Ebeni awomaku bibi bya awose kpa wa gbayi ebeni aba yogwu okwunu ki Ibru mo Amagedo.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Ebeni oyoleho ko omwahapa pyashu kakanu bwa ake shipu kowu. Oko nwa bwo obe ipu kole ko Owuso, kamo, &lt;&lt;Okweyi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Owusotasha, owusogbo, akpula gbo kweyi agye ja kotata. Bwishi ni aya asuse ni agye ja mani ebyibye walo; omani pini wa agye ni ja she ni la! <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Ogya nyakwu ko wi ikpo eta, kweyi awogya nyakwu ko okpagye kpiri kya. Owuso rela ko okpagye nyakwu ko Obabila kweyi yo gwinyi bwa abwa nu, inyi ka anya nu kotata. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Awokpagye ni inyo shogba tuwa ni kpiri gebi, awefu kpiri gebi. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Owuso yiwo ka akyo ni lenu kotata ni, shonu bwi iso wasa awase ni so Owuso esa ikweyi ke ebi ka akyo ni oyiwo ni, ikweyi koni owe ebi labi labi ni.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s">Agbaza ni Ananoho Gyo ni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Ebeni oye ipu ka ayoleho ahapa ni gba ake ahapa ni wa tami kweyi kamo, &lt;&lt;Wa, nyya shiya awo owe ni aba da agbaza ni agyo ni, ogya nyakwu ni ama kwi ishu nwashika ni. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />Awose kese ba beba kpa anu, kweyi ase kese ba ya kpi inyi keba boba nu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Omaku ko Owuso kpumogwu, kweyi oyoleho byun go ododa. Ebeni nmo onya ni yagye ikweyi ko obekwu nowa ni gbe enena ki iye kesa sosa ko Owuso ni ata ikpiye nu kpiri ni. Obekwu oni gbi ikweyi ahapa kpa agyi igwo. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Onya mani shoshiye inyi ki ishikpuru kpo onowa kweyi ikpiye nu kpiri wo ozinariya, akyo-neshi kpa awekye ni gbakwekye ni. Obya abwa nwonwu kpo ozinariya kpo ozalabi kpa awoza kobwa, ikweyi ke eba boba nu. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Ogo nu atiye ni gbase leba ni mo: &lt;&lt;<note caller="+" style="fe"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Great Babylon</char></note>Obabila Nyakwu, ene ka agbaza kpiri kpi ino gyese egya kpiri.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Kweyi nmo onya mani ya kpo oyi kase ko Owuso kpo oyi kase ni ayuwa ngmo ikweyi koni ayo olobene ko Oyesu ni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Ishini nmo ni, igbashi yun kwu kotata. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Oyoleho dumoka mo, &lt;&lt;Oji ya ni igbashi yo kwu?&gt;&gt; Nyya kase teba ko onya mani kpa ako obekwu ni zo ni dawo, obekwu ni gbo ikweyi ahapa kpo agyi igwo ni. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Obekwu ni oma ni gbo olayi ishi oye, anani oke gbo olayi kelo; owa bwipu ko ogo ni gbomeyi lo ni kweyi oya ga koni aba ga yo ngmo ni. Awase ni bese ni atiye wa ipu ko okpa ko olayi ome ana yese lo ni, igbashi ya yuwa kwu ishini amo obekwu ni. Ishi oye ogbo olayi; anani ogbo olayi kelo, oke ki ya kwikye yawa.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />&lt;&lt;Ase ni wine koziyi kpogyogye oya gyikweyi kela mani. Ikweyi ahapa oni wi ikpokyi ahapa, ni onya mani yagye ikweyi wa ni. Aki gba awose ahapa: <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />eho ipu wa kwobonu gbo wa, oye tayayo ya kpogwu, oye ke wa walo; ishini owa owotiri koni oya kpogwu kishi gbayayi ni. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Obekwu ni gbo olayi ishi oye ni, anani oke gekwu, anu abiyinu wose ko omwahata ni woye ipu ka ahapa, oya gebe ni aba yo ngmo ni.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />&lt;&lt;Agyi igwo ni omani wa awose igwo ni kwotu ko kpogwu walo ni, ake ba dawo oshu ko kpogwu byo ose ki ishi gbayayi kpo obekwu. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Awose igwo mani kpiri oza ni yotu wa wo oye kponu, ayo oshu wa do obekwu. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Aba nonu kpo Oyi ko Otukpo, Oyi ko Otukpo ke kpa awase ni ashu ni kpe ewa kotu nu ni gbotuse ni ba gwawose mani agye, ikweyi koni owa Adole ka awadole kpo Ose ka awose.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Oyoleho ki ka dami mo, &lt;&lt;Inyo ni oma agbaza yagye anu oni, wa awokpagye kpiri, ase kpiri, ikpo kase kpiri, kpi igbenu kpiri. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Awagyi igwo kpo obekwu ni oma ni ba yimu ka agbaza lo; aba yoza kpiri ni ogbo ni yikpo, aba shobita ewewa; aba yebe kikpiye nu ha kweyi yoyi kpo ola. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />Koni Owuso ya awose mani kpiri ko yela oye kponu kweyi kyogwu ko yoshu wa do obekwu mani, aba ya mani gbishini oza ni Owuso kani wa gbodagye.<verse eid="REV 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />&lt;&lt;Onya ni omani wogya nyakwu ni kpogwu ka awose kese mani.<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s">Igbo ko Obabila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Itikpi ko omani nmo oyoleho oye yawa bwi iso. Ogbo oshu nyakwu, igyashi nu yese mani yu kpiri. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Oyoleho ngmegba kpoko nwaa mo: &lt;&lt;Ogbo! Obabila gbo! Awomaku bibi ni gbinyi ni ba bipu nu; edo ko oza ni shoshi lo ni kpa awigbano ni gbinyi ni ase ba fu ni bipu nu. <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Ikweyi koni ase kese kpiri gwinyi nu. Inyi loshu keba boba nu. Awose kese ba gwutagye kpa anu, awino yi ipishi kese kpiri wo olodu ikweyi koza bibi keba ni oya shibita lo ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Ebeni nki pwoko oye bwi iso ya kamo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">&lt;&lt;Ala bose, ase hin! Ala bose shobita!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">Ala ka gba abo ipu ko ozalabi nu lo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">ala ka gbingbo ipu ko owe nu lo!<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Koni ozalabi nu tukpa sikpokyi gi iso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">kweyi Owuso ya rela ko bibi nu.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Ala yo oza byoni oya ala ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">ala sore igbepa ko oza kpiri ni oya ala ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:6">Ya abwa nu na nwu igbepa kpi inyi loshu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">byi inyi ni oda ala ni.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Ala danu owe kotata kpotu byobya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">shi igyashi kpo onye ni odi iyi nu ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Ikweyi oka di iyinu mo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">&lt;Nyyagye ebe mani, nwo onya ni rose!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">Nwo onyokwu la lo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">Nyya gyotu byobya lo!&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Ikweyi ko omani, eno oye ebi ya yo ngmo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">ose, otubyobya kpe emye ya yo ngmo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">Aba yoyi kpo ola,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">ikweyi koni Adole Owuso ni ya kepwo ni gyokwu shaha.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Awose kese ni beba kpa anu ni ba kyegba ikweyi ko ogya nyakwu ishini ami iwola kola ni yayo ni. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Ahagye ebe lenu kpa anu, ikweyi koni aba yoshi ko mowe kpanu. Akamo, &lt;&lt;Owe nu ya lemoji! Oya shoshi lo! Obabila mani wo ogya nyakwu! Ipu kishi oye kponu omegye!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Awoyotoyu kese mani kyegba ki ba byotu mamani ikweyi nu, ikweyi koni ashishe riyo wa kelo; <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />Ashishe rozinariya, azurupa, okpo neshi, kpekye ni gbakwekye ni; kpo opa neshi, oshiye inyi kishi kpuru, owulu kposhiye nowa; kpedo kashini koza ni aya kpefu ni ya kpehe neshi kpoza ni aba ya kpodu kebe nyakwu, kpefu, awowatu, ogye fufukwu kpokpo yoyu; <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />omu ka apata kefu ni aba yogwu mo osinamo ni, iyo ko obobo, ozakpehe, apata kefu ni aba yogwu mo omayiri ni, kpo omu ki ikpiye kefu ni aba yogwu mo ofrakises ni; inyi kpa ano, omu kpe ewo, ena kpo otukpo, onya kpo oza ko biyo nu, oshe, kpo olayi kasuse. <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Awoyotoyu kada nu mo, &lt;&lt;Kpiri kawoza ni oyimu ko gbo ni gebi, odu wo kpiri kpo oyi bawa kweyi, oya pyuwa kelo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Awoyotoyu, ni gbodu ogya nyakwu oni, ba hagye lenu kpa nu, ikweyi koni aba yoshi ko gbingbo ko owe moma nu. Aba kyegba kpo otubyobya, <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />kweyi akamo, &lt;&lt;Ebi, ebi, Owe nu ya lemoji! Oya shoshi do ogya nyakwu lo! Oya shoshiye ko opa ni gbogye, inyi kishi kpuru, iyo nowa, kweyi agwagya kpo ozinariya kpo okpo neshi kpe ekye neshi ni gbakwekye ni! <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Ipu kishi gbayayi odu nu mani kpiri kweyi!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Awopowu ki inyo kpase ni bipu nu, oteyi ka awopowu kpa ashini kase ni ba pyoza rore wa bwi ishu, wa hagye ebe lenu, <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />ni ami iwola kola ni ya yo ni asheha mo: &lt;&lt;Okpagye wonya lebyo okpagye nyakwu mani wa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Afa agye shi ikweyi, aba kyegba ba byotu mo, &lt;&lt;Ebi! Ebi yo ogya nyakwu mani re wa! Owogya nyakwu ni kpiri kase ni gbo owu ki inyo ba sheyi ki inya ba wo olodu bwebe ko odu ko onya mani! Kweyi ipu kishi gbayayi ojoji kweyi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Ala ase kiso, ala shotunehe, ikweyi kikwu nu! Ala shotunehe, ase ko Owuso, kpa ayikoko ko Oyesu kpa awobane! Koni Owuso kwepwo ko oza ni oyala ni!<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Ebeni oyoleho nyakwu zi ikyikpo ni gyokwu bye ego ni kweyi yi ta gipu ki ishu, ya kamo, &lt;&lt;Mamani aba yo ogya nyakwu ko Obabila ya ta ga agye koshu kweyi aba mo ebyibye ke lo. <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Ashishe ya pwoko ki igye wowo kwe eya ko okwuburu, kwa amada kpajigwo kelo! Aba pya awoyoko ko otoyu oyoye kelo; kweyi aba pwe eya ke ego ogya mani kelo! <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Aba mola ki ikwomu ipu wo kelo; aba pwoko ka awonyape kpo obu wa ipu wo kelo. Awoyotoyu wo pini loshu she kpiri ese la, kweyi abodiyi kokame wo gyase kese kpiri egya!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Ado Obabila owe ikweyi koyi kawo bane kpase ko Owuso ni apye ipu nu ni; olemani, oyi kawase kpiri ni ayi ngmo ese mani.<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Itikpi ko omani, npwo oje byo oko kewa kasuse ipu ki iso ya kamo, &lt;&lt;Sho Owuso iye! Ongmongma, igyashi, kpo oshu wako Owuso ka! <verse eid="REV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />Epwo koka nu wokwokwoshi kpo otata! Oya gbaza ni yese bya kpe eba boba nu ni yi ngmo. Owuso gbo ogo agye ikweyi koni ongmo ayoleho nu ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Aki sheha mo, &lt;&lt;Sho Owuso iye! Iwola bwi igbenu kola ni yo ogya nyakwu yola ni gi iso ko gbogbo-gbogbo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Anyakwase awepa ayene kpo oza ni gbo olayi ene kwagye ba geyagye do Owuso, ni yo obe ni. Akamo, &lt;&lt;Sho Owuso iye! Nalemani!<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Onyape ko Oyi ko Otukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Ebeni oko kela bwo obe kamo, &lt;&lt;Sho Owuso ka iye, kpiri ka ayole nu kpase kpiri, ayileke kpa anyakwase ni gboshi nu ni!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Ebeni npwe eye ko oko kewa kasuse, bye eya ki inyo ni ya shonu ni, bye eya ka akpula ni ya gbo ni. Npwu wa ba kamo, &lt;&lt;Sho Owuso iye! Adole Owuso ka, Ine koshu kpiri, wo Ose! <verse eid="REV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Ahan yeye kpo otunehe; ahan shi igyashi nu iye! Ishi gye ki imya ko onyape ko Oyi ko Otukpo, kweyi onyape kyi iyinutu ya gbeyi nu. <verse eid="REV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Aba danu opa nehe ko shoko.&gt;&gt; (Opa nehe mani woza neshi yoya kase ko Owuso.)<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Ebene oyoleho ka dami mo, &lt;&lt;Ta awoza mani: Otunehe yo kpa awase ni apawa ko gi imya ko onyape ko Oyi ko Otukpo ko Owuso.&gt;&gt; Kweyi oyoleho ki kamo, &lt;&lt;Omani wela ni wa bwebe ko Owuso kwokwoshi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Nkwagye obutu nu ko geyagye danu, anu ke ka dami mo, &lt;&lt;Ka ya mani lo! Ami wo oyole bya awo kpa ashini ka awogboso, awase ni gbo kwokwoshi ni Oyesu sayi dawa ni. Geyagye do Owuso!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 19:10">Koni okwokwoshi ni Oyesu sayi ni woza ni da awinobane oshu ni.<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ase Sonya Nehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Ebeni nmi iso gwa, kweyi nmo onya nehe. Inoso ayogwu mo otuse kpo okwokwoshi; oya kepwo nu kpo okwokwoshi kweyi oya kpefu nu. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Iyi nu gola byi igbenu ko ola, kweyi olo otu nwashika ikweyi nu. Atiye ikpiye nu, ashishe gyikweyi kiye ni lo, anu fufunu pini gye la. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Oshiye ni oshu ni gbo oyi nwashika. Aba yogwu mo, &lt;&lt;Ela ko Owuso.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Awadakare ki iso ni sonya nehe kweyi gboso, asho oshiye nehe purututu. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Ewakpa rore, ni oya yo oko kpa anu ko kpefu ro okpagye shishini bose okwunu nu. Oya kpuwogwu kpo otu obibi nu, kweyi oya pyinyi obutu ko Owuso, inyi ka anya Owuso ine koshu kpiri. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Oshiye nu kpa atakwu nu otiye anu mo: &lt;&lt;Ose ka awose kpa Adole ka awa Adole.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Ebeni nmo oyoleho hagye ikweyi ke eno. Kweyi osheha ya awigbano kpiri ni bawu ni ogwu mo: &lt;&lt;Ala wa wa gbayi ko roza nyakwu ki imya ko onyape ko Owuso! <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />Ala wa hebe ka awose, awokpogwu, kpo awadakare, ebe ka awonya kpa awosonya, ebe ko oshe kpase ni woshe lo ni, anyakwase kpa ayileke!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Ebeni nmo obekwu kpa awose kese kpo awadakare wa ni gbayi kpefu kpase ni sonya kpo adakare nu ni. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Ayo obekwu yikwu shetu kpa awobane ko okame ni yi igbashi obutu nu ni. &lt;&lt;Oyoko kpi igbashi nu mani kweyi gya awase ni amyuwa enena ko obekwu egya kpa awase ni geyagye do oyi ko obekwu ni.&gt;&gt; Obekwu kpo awobane ko okame atuwa kpo olayi shibwu ko ola ni ya kye kpe ehola ni. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Aya ashini wa ngmo kpe ewakpa ni bwo okwunu kase ni sonya ni. Awigbano kpiri hebe wa byo ni aba gege ba ha ni.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s">Ishayi Okpakwu Oye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Ebeni nmo oyoleho ko Owuso yawa bwi iso wo okpagye, obyo oba ko ogo ni gbomeyi lo ni, obya ashirika gyokwu abonu. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Oyo egwa nyakwu yi kwu, egwa nekye, oni anu ni wo ibiri ni, asha ashirika ka ashayi okpakwu oye. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Oyoleho ko Owuso to go ko ogo ni gbomeyi lo ni, oyogwu kweyi yoba shini ona ka gyase egya lo gbishini ishayi okpakwu oye ni na shigbo. Itikpi ko oni aba yo gwa ki ishi gbayayi. <verse eid="REV 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Ebeni nma awobe kpase ni bagye ikweyi wa ni, adawo oshu ko kepwo. Nki mo omaku kawase ni ayuwa ngmo ikweyi koni akokwokwoshi ni Oyesu sayi kpe ela ko Owuso ni. Ageyagye do obekwu kwo oyi nu lo, ake tenena ko obekwu ogo wa kwe abo wa lo. Apyo olayi kweyi arose kpo Okristi ki ishayi okpakwu oye. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />(Ashini ko okwu shiyi lo gbishini ishayi okpakwu oye ni shigbo.) Omani wi ikyikyo ko nyiso bwikwu. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Otunehe kpo aboneshi nyakwu wa kawase ni wa kikyikyo ni ayuwa nyiso bwikwu ni. Ikwu ko omwepa gboshu ikweyi wa lo; aba wa awosapa ko Owuso kpa ako Okristi kweyi aba kpogwu kpa anu ki ishayi okpakwu oye.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayi Ibiri Gwagye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Ishini ishayi okpakwu mani shigbo, aba yi Ibiri ya ngma sho oruduru nu, <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />Oya gese koga gyase ni bese kpiri ni egya, ni wo Ogog kpo Omagog ni, Ibiri ya kpuwa gbayi kpiri ko kpefu, anwashika byikpo kisisagye ki ishu. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Apasha ipu kese aki shogba te ebe ni ayi ko Owuso banu kpo ogya nyakwu ni oya yimu ni. Ola ke bwi iso yuwa yi kpiri. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Kweyi Ibiri ni gyuwegya ni ato gipu kola kpe ehola, ebeni obekwu kpa awobane kokame akwobonu kpuwa sho wa; kweyi aba mowe kotu ke eno ko gbogbo-gbogbo.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Epwo ko Gwejeji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Kweyi nmo obe nyakwu ni wo nehe ni kpase ni yagye anu ni. Ese kpi iso gebi sho obutu nu aki muwa kelo. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Ebeni nma awase ni gekwu ni, ka anyakwase ka ayileke abo oye kponu hagye obutu ko obe. Agwawokpa, aki gwokpa oye, ni wo okpa kolayi ni. Ake epwo kawase ni gekwu ni ikweyi koza ni aya ni, byoni ayita ipu kawokpa ni. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Ishu bose kpawo okwu ni bipu nu ni. Ikwu kpo aleku ki bya awokwu ni bipu wa ni wese, Akepwo ikweyi wa kpiri ikweyi koza ni aya ni. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Kweyi ikwu kpa aleku atuwa gola. (Ibwu ko ola mani wikwu ko omwepa.) <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Awase ni iyewa bipu kokpa kolayi lo ni, atuwa gipu kibwu kola ko gbogbo-gbogbo.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s">Iso pepe kpe Ese pepe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Ebeni nmi iso pepe kpe ese pepe. Iso kikyikyo kpe ese kikyikyo gebi, ishu gebi. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Nmo Ogya Neshi, Ojerusele pepe, bwi iso ebe ko Owuso ya wokpagye, akyanutu kweyi gwagya byo onyape ni ya gbeyi kobu nu ni. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Npwo oko nwaa ya kela bwo obe kamo: &lt;&lt;Anani ole ko Owuso yo kpa asuse! Oya yagye kpawa, kweyi awa ba wase nu. Owuso abiyinu yayo kpawa, anu ya wo Owuso wa. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Oya wuwize kpiri iyi. Ikwu ya yaba kelo, otu byobya kwe egba kyokye kwo odose ya yaba kelo, oza nekye kwobonu shigbo wa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Aseni yo obe ni kamo, &lt;&lt;Kweyi anani nyyojoji ya wo pepe!&gt;&gt; Oki ka dami mo, &lt;&lt;Toza mani, ikweyi koni ela mani wo kwokwoshi ni ase ya gege ya yotu so ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Okamo, &lt;&lt;okweyi wa! Nwwi kikyikyo kpo ogwejeji, okwotu kpo okweyi. Aseni ni igyini ya ngmo kpiri nyya danu inyo niwa bwibwu kinyo ko olayi ni oya sore lo ni. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Awase ni rogwa aba pyoza mani bwebe hin, nyya wo Owuso wa, aba wayi hin. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Awino yoshi ke, awo yase ra, awo romeme, awongmase, awobeba, awo yabodiyi, awo geyagye deka kpawo kokame kpiri, ebewa wibwu ni wikwu ko omwepa ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ojerusele Pepe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Oye ipu ka ayoleho ahapa ni gba ake ahapa, ni nwonwu kpe ebi ahapa ni webe hin kweyi kamo, &lt;&lt;Wa, nyya shawo onyape, onya ko Oyi Ko Otukpo.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Omaku kpumogwu, kweyi oyoleho zun giso ke efu ni wirikpo kotata ni. Oshami Ojerusele, Ogya Neshi, bwi iso ebe ko Owuso ya wokpagye <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />yayu kpigyashi ko Owuso. Ogya nyakwu oni ya yu byo Ojaspa, oya yu byo okpo nehe. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Ogbo okpe nyakwu ni wirikpo ni kweyi gbo owe kofunu igwepa kpa ayoleho igwepa ni ba gbeho ko owe ni. Atiye ka awipwoma igwepa ki Izrayila awowe kofunu oni. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Owe kofunu eta ba agbabo wonyonya, eta agbabo ka ahanokyi, eta agbabo ko onose, eta agbabo kikpokyi, eta agbabo ke ekye. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Amo okpe ko ogya nyakwu mani ikweyi kikyikpo igwepa kotu koda, ni atiye ka ayikoko ko Oyi ko Otukpo ikweyi wa ni. <verse eid="REV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Oyoleho ni ya kela dami ni gbo okposhi ko myoza ko ozinariya ko myo ogya nyakwu, kpa awofunu nu kpa agaya nu. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Ogya nyakwu mani gyogye agbabo kpiri, byoni ogwogwa nu kpikpo nu gyogye ni. Oyoleho myo ogya nyakwu mani kpo okposhi ko myoza nu. Ikpo nu wo omeli okpaku oye so ogbogbo epa, kogwogwa nu, ki ikpo nu kpiri woye kponu kpi igbo nu. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Oyoleho ki mya agaya, Ogiso nu wi ikpo ogbogbo epa si igwihiri, bwebe ko myoza kasuse ni oyoleho ya yoko kpanu ni. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Ama agaya nu kpo ojaspa, ogya nyakwu mani abiyinu ke amo kpo ozinariya, ya yu byi iyimebe. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Ikyikpo kotu ko okpe ko ogya mani agwagya kpe edo kikyikpo neshi wonyonya. Ikyikpo kikyikyo ni akwotu koda ni wo ojaspa, ko omwepa wo osafaya, komweta wa agate, ko omene we emera, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />ko omeho wo oniksi, ko omwihiri wo okaneliyan, ko omwahapa wo okwas inyikayi, ko omwahata wo oberil, ko omwahane wo otopaz, ko omwigwo wo oshalsadoni, ko omwigwoye wo otokwoyis, ko omwigwepa wa ametisi. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Awofunu igwepa mani we ekye igwepa ni gbakwekye ni; ofunu wonyonya ayo kpe ekye oye. Owe ko ogya nyakwu mani ayo kpo ozinariya, ni ya mebe byi iyimebe ni. <verse eid="REV 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Nmole ko Owuso ipu ko ogya nyakwu mani lo, ikweyi koni ole ko Owuso nu wa Adole Owuso Ine koshu kpiri kpo Oyi ko Otukpo. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Ogya nyakwu mani ya yimu keno kwoya koyu anu lo, ikweyi koni igyashi ko Owuso ya yu ipu nu, kweyi Oyi ko Otukpo wi ikwomu nu. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Ase kese mani ba yawu kpo oyoyu nu, awose kese mani ba byo odu wa wipu nu. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Opunu ko ogya nyakwu mani ya gwogwa eno kpiri; aba yogwu lo, ikweyi koni otu yaba ebeni lo. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Aba byi igyashi kpo odu kokpagye kpiri wipu ko ogya nyakwu oni. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Ozani ke gbinyi oya gipu ko ogya nyakwu mani lo, kwe ase ni yoza kiweyi kwi ino kokame. Awase ni atiye wa ipu kokpa ko olayi ko Oyi ko Otukpo ni pini ba gipu ko ogya nyakwu mani la.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Oyoleho ko Owuso ki shiyami ishu kinyo ko olayi, ya kye byo oza ni ya yu ni, kweyi yawa bwo obe ko Owuso kpako Oyi ko Otukpo <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />kweyi oya pe go otutehe ko owe ko ogya nyakwu mani. Agbabo ki ishu kpiri gbe efu ko olayi, ni ya gwa igbi igwepa ipu ki ishayi ni; igboye ipu koya; kweyi efu nu ya dase ko okpagye kpiri ogege. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Ojije ni Owuso yokwunu ni yayo ogya nyakwu mani lo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:3">Obe ko Owuso kpako Oyi ko Otukpo ya yogya nyakwu mani, kweyi ayole nu ba geyagye danu. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Aba miyi nu, kweyi aba yi iye nu ta ogo wa. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Otu ya yaba kelo, kweyi aba doka koyoyu ke eno kwe emu kelo, ikweyi koni Adole Owuso ya wo oyoyu wa, kweyi aba kpogwu byo ose ko gbogbo-gbogbo.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Owowa ko Oyesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Kweyi oyoleho ko Owuso kadami mo, &lt;&lt;Ela mani wokwokwoshi ni ase ya yotuso ni. Kweyi Adole Owuso, ni da awinobane Omaku, to oyoleho nu oleho ko sha ayole nu oza ni ya wa gbodagye ipu kishi gbayayi ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />Oyesu kamo. &lt;&lt;Ala pwo! Nyya wa papa! Otunehe yo kpa awase ni geyagye dela ni abane ipu kokpa mani!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Ami, Oyohana, npwo ki mawoza mani kpiri. Ishini npwo ki muwa kweyi ni, ngbo okpagye ikpo ko oyoleho ni shami awoza mani, kweyi nyyimu ko geyagye danu. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Oke kadami, &lt;&lt;Kaya lo! Nwwo oyole bya awo kpa ayene wo awobane kpa awase ni ba geyagye dela ni yipu kokpa mani la. Geyagye do Owuso!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="REV 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Kweyi oka dami mo, &lt;&lt;Ka yela ni abane ipu ko okpa mani yi teba lo, ikweyi koni ishi ya ya wa ni awoza mani ba gbodagye ni. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Aseni yayo obibi na gohobu ko yobibi, kweyi ase ni ya yoza kobwa na gohobu ko yoza kobwa; ase ni yayo oneshi na gohobu ko yo neshi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />Oyesu kamo, &lt;&lt;Ala pwo! Nyya wa papa! Abola hin yo kpami, ko dananoho ikweyi koza ni oya ni. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Ami wi ikyikyo kpo ogwejeji, ami wo okwotu kpo ongmeyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Otunehe yo kpa awase ni yoshiye wa na neshi ni, agboshu ko ho ogwogwa kefu ko olayi kweyi aba gipu kogya nyakwu bwofunu oba. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Ese ko ogya nyakwu ke wawo romeme kpa awo yabodiyi, awobeba kpa awongmase, awogeyagye deka kpa awokokame ebe kela koka kpoza yoya wa.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />&lt;&lt;Ami, Oyesu, nto oyoleho hin oleho ko kawoza mani dala oda Owuso. Nwwoyi ki ipwoma ko Odawuda; ami winyiwo kotukpokyi ni ya yu ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Omaku kpo Onyape kamo, &lt;&lt;Wa!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Kpiri kase ni pwela mani ki ba kamo, &lt;&lt;Wa!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Wa, ase ni igyini ya ngmo; na nyeshi kinyo ko olayi, ase kpiri ni yimu.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ongmeyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Ami, Oyohana, nyya pya nanoho ni pwela ko bane ko okpa mani akpaha: ase ni foje manu, Owuso ya fowe ke ebi ni aka ipu ko okpa mani manu dawa. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Ase ni ngmo oje bwipu kela ko okpa kobane mani, Owuso ya ngma bwipu ko gwogwa kefu ko olayi ni aba gbingbo ni kpo Ogya ko Owuso, ni akela nu ipu ko okpa mani.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Aseni yolobene nu ikweyi kawoza mani ya kamo, &lt;&lt;Olemani kwokwoshi! Nyya wa papa!&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Nalemani. Wa, Adole Oyesu!<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Nyya beshi ka Adole Oyesu na yo kpase kpiri. Nalemani!<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>